Arara Code: keep an empty window usable before the start-screen provider responds.

Why a patch: extensions cannot render the native empty editor watermark or set
initial sidebar layout before workbench restoration. Preserve stored layout;
only the default for a new window shows Explorer. Keep native folder/recent
actions available when tips are disabled in an empty window or the provider
is absent, empty or fails. Extension sections still replace this fallback.
Touches: editorGroupWatermark.ts and browser/layout.ts.

